  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mythic power fuels one of your lesser spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Minor Spell Expertise, ability to cast 4th-level spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can cast any spell you have selected with Minor Spell Expertise feat as a spell-like ability an additional number of times per day equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc87\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
